{"id":"vores","title":"Vores","topic":"css","topicLabel":"CSS","tags":["aprendizaje","css"],"course":null,"headings":[{"depth":2,"text":"¿Qué es?","id":"que-es"},{"depth":2,"text":"¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)","id":"como-se-escribe-sintaxis"}],"readingMins":1,"codeBlocks":0.5,"words":53,"backlinks":[{"id":"sesion-07-18-05-26","title":"Sesion_07_18.05.26","topicLabel":"HTML","session":7}],"html":"<h2 id=\"que-es\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Qué es?</h2><p>Permeten dibuixar línies al voltant dels elements. Pots triar el gruix, el color i l&#39;estil (sòlid, puntejat, etc.). Una propietat molt usada és <code>border-radius</code>, que serveix per arrodonir les cantonades i fer que no siguin tan puntegudes .</p>\n<h2 id=\"como-se-escribe-sintaxis\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)</h2><div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">css</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-selector-class\">.caja</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">border</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">2px</span> solid <span class=\"hljs-number\">#1F4E78</span>;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">border-radius</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">10px</span>;\n}</code></pre></div>"}